            "review_text": "Данил\nSt. Petersburg, Russia3 contributions\n0\nDisappointing experience: Dirty, long wait, and poor food\nJan 2026 • Friends\nWe visited in the evening and were immediately disappointed by the hygiene. The place was very dirty, and the tables around us were left uncleared.\nWe ordered the large seafood and meat set, which took 50 minutes to arrive. When it finally did, the quality was poor. The oysters were inedible, the sauce was disgusting, and the meat was so tough it was impossible to chew. The only edible items were the shrimps and sausages. The rice was not bad, but everything else was a letdown.\nOn top of that, the attitude towards guests was terrible. We left very upset and cannot recommend this place\nRead more\nWritten January 19, 2026\nLucie Nguyen\nThank you for sharing your feedback. We take all reviews seriously, and we would like to clarify a few important points regarding your visit to Lantern Garden in Nha Trang.\n\nRegarding table clearing — our restaurant follows a standard table-clearing procedure to ensure smooth turnover, especially during peak evening hours. While we aim to clear tables promptly, there can occasionally be a short delay during high traffic periods. That said, it is unusual for this to be described as “very dirty,” and we are reviewing the specific shift to understand what may have led to this perception.\n\nConcerning hygiene — Lantern Garden takes cleanliness extremely seriously. The restaurant is cleaned thoroughly before and after operating hours, and our restrooms are inspected and cleaned every hour throughout service. We are therefore unclear about what specifically was considered unhygienic, as no issue was raised with our team at the time of the visit.\n\nAs for the seafood and meat set, taste preferences can vary across cultures and individual expectations. The dishes mentioned, including the oysters and sauce, are regularly ordered and positively reviewed by many guests. If any item had not met expectations, our staff would have immediately addressed or replaced it had we been informed during the meal.\n\nWe are also surprised that no concern was communicated to our team on site, as we always encourage guests to speak with us directly so we can resolve matters immediately. Our goal is never for a guest to leave dissatisfied.\n\nLantern Garden remains committed to maintaining high standards in food quality, hygiene, and service. If you are willing, we invite you to contact us directly with more details about your visit so we can properly investigate.\nRead more\nWritten February 5, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
