            "review_text": "Ezekiel L\nNha Trang, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nUnforgettable Dinner at Lantern Garden – Great Food, Vibes & Service!\nJun 2025 • Friends\nIf you're in Nha Trang and looking for a memorable dining experience, Lantern Garden is a must-visit. We tried the Fuji Beef on Hot Stone – tender, juicy, and so fun to cook right at the table. The Claypot Vermicelli with Thai-Style Prawns was packed with flavor, and the Garlic Bread was the perfect starter. Everything paired perfectly with an ice-cold Heineken.\n\nWhat really stood out was the superb service – friendly, attentive, and always with a smile. The chill, open-air environment with good music made the evening even more enjoyable.\n\nWe’ll definitely be back again. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten June 6, 2025\nLucie Nguyen\nThank you so much for your wonderful and detailed review! 💚 We're thrilled to hear that your dinner at Lantern Garden was unforgettable — from the Fuji Beef on Hot Stone to the Claypot Vermicelli and ice-cold Heineken, it sounds like you enjoyed every moment.\n\nWe're especially happy to know that our team’s friendly and attentive service made a great impression, and that the open-air setting and music added to the overall experience.\n\nWe truly appreciate your recommendation and can’t wait to welcome you back on your next visit to Nha Trang! 🌿🥩🍤✨\nRead more\nWritten July 25, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
