            "review_text": "Bun Quay A Ken\nNha Trang, Vietnam77 contributions\n0\nUnforgettable Night at Lantern Garden – Chilli Crab & Cool Vibes All the Way!\nApr 2025 • Friends\nWe arrived at Lantern Garden around 5 PM and ended up staying all the way until 1 AM—it was that good! The atmosphere is amazing with a cool evening breeze, cozy outdoor seating, and chill yet vibrant music that set the perfect mood.\n\nThe Singapore Chilli Crab was out of this world—flavorful, rich, and slightly spicy with a sweet tang that keeps you craving more with every bite. Hands down the best I’ve had in Vietnam.\n\nThe Lantern Signature Fried Rice was fluffy, eggy, and packed with prawns—truly superb. We also tried the Glass Noodles Thai Style, which had a deep, complex flavor with just the right amount of spice.\n\nIt’s not just the food—it’s the whole experience. From the attentive staff to the dreamy garden lights and relaxing vibe, Lantern Garden is where great food and unforgettable nights come together. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nLook out for all their Signature dishes, you wont regret. The price is super reasonable.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 29, 2025\nLucie Nguyen\nWow! Thank you so much for such a heartfelt and detailed review! 💚 We're absolutely thrilled that you had such an unforgettable evening with us—from 5 PM to 1 AM, that's the best compliment we could ask for!\n\nWe're so happy you enjoyed the Singapore Chilli Crab and our Lantern Signature Fried Rice—both dishes are made with love and it means the world to know they hit the mark. And thank you for mentioning the atmosphere too; we really do our best to create a space where food, music, and vibes come together perfectly.\n\nWe'll be sure to share your kind words with the entire team. Looking forward to welcoming you back for another magical night soon! ✨🦀🌿\nRead more\nWritten June 5, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
